# Elevator FSM

## Goal

Learn how to implement a more advanced Finite State Machine (FSM) in Verilog by designing a simplified elevator controller.

## Concepts Learned

- finite state machine (FSM)
- states
- state transitions
- sequential logic
- clock
- reset
- case statement
- state encoding
- input-driven transitions

